                                "sense_id": "c2ed5022-6e67-3c2a-ad5a-60a15dba79dd",
                                "text": "Our convincing evidence was sufficient in the end to win the trial."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "05ee77d9-b0df-4ac4-8b72-a2e9c1f364a1",
                                "sense_id": "c2ed5022-6e67-3c2a-ad5a-60a15dba79dd",
                                "text": "While they have still only suffered one home defeat by Spurs in 19 years, this was not as convincing a victory as the scoreline suggests."
